                  // backwards and land on their BACK rather than face-down in the dirt. The facing
                  // flip stays at the head of the transform list, so which way they topple still
                  // follows which way they were pointing. Purely visual: the hitbox is untouched,
                  // so a downed enemy is still shot, burned and hit exactly where it was standing.
